    "ruleNumber": "01.05",
    "order": 25,
    "anchor": "01.05",
    "summary": "Dice are six-sided (D6) and rolls are written as:\n\n- **2+**: 2 or higher.\n- **1-3**: any result in that range, both ends included.\n- **2D6**: roll 2 D6 and add them up.\n- **D3**: roll 1 D6, halve it and round up.\n- **D6+1**: roll the dice, then add the number after the plus.",
